den":false,"productId":"245","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: FK120","c":[]},{"h":"Fan Dimensions: 120×120×25 mm(L×W×H)","c":[]},{"h":"Fan Airflow: 68.99 CFM","c":[]},{"h":"Bearing Type: Fluid Dynamic Bearing","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty : 1 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The DeepCool FK120 High-Performance 120mm PWM Casing Cooling Fan is engineered to deliver exceptional cooling performance while maintaining a quiet operation. It's an ideal choice for enhancing airflow in your PC case, radiator, or CPU cooler.</p><h3>Key Specifications</h3><ul><li>Fan Speed: 500–1850 RPM ±10%</li><li>Airflow: 68.99 CFM</li><li>Static Pressure: 2.19 mmAq</li><li>Noise Level: ≤28 dB(A)</li><li>Bearing Type: Fluid Dynamic Bearing</li><li>Connector: 4-pin PWM</li><li>Rated Voltage: 12 VDC</li><li>Rated Current: 0.12 A</li><li>Power Consumption: 1.44 W</li><li>Dimensions: 120×120×25 mm</li><li>Weight: 170 g</li><li>Material: Polybutylene Terephthalate (PBT)</li></ul><h3>Features &amp; Performance</h3><ul><li>Elite Cooling Efficiency: The FK120 operates within a dynamic PWM range of 500 to 1850 RPM, providing a balance between high airflow and low noise levels.</li><li>Enhanced Static Pressure: With a maximum static pressure of 2.19 mmAq, it's effective in pushing air through dense heatsinks and radiators.</li><li>Quiet Operation: At full load, the fan maintains a noise level of ≤28 dB(A), ensuring a quiet computing environment.</li><li>Durable Construction: Made from high-quality PBT material, the FK120 offers increased durability and wear resistance.</li><li>Vibration Reduction: Shock-absorbing rubber pads at the screw mounts help reduce unnecessary vibrations for stable operation.​</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"r